# Foot Elite: "Whenever this creature attacks, another target creature you control gets +1/+0 and gains indestructible until end of turn." Bot1 casts it
# for {2}{W/B} (Mox Jet pays the hybrid black) on turn 1 with a Memnite and an Ornithopter; Bot2 casts a Llanowar Elves on turn 2. On turn 3 the trigger
# cannot target the Foot Elite itself or Bot2's Llanowar Elves (both refused) and Bot1 targets the Memnite: a 2/1 with indestructible, power only (the
# toughness stays 1), while the Ornithopter and the Foot Elite get neither. The effect ends with the turn: on turn 5 the Memnite is a 1/1 again.

